OL,3,AUS envoys arrive in Moscow ahead of
OL,4,AUkraine talks
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrump told reporters on Friday the pair
OL,7,Fwere "bringing with them a proposal to
OL,8,Fend the war". So far, efforts from the
OL,9,FUS and its allies to broker a peace
OL,10,Fdeal have failed to deliver a
OL,11,Fbreakthrough.
OL,13,FUS news outlet Axios reported the US
OL,14,Fenvoys would separately meet both
OL,15,FRussian President Vladimir Putin and
OL,16,FUkrainian President Volodymyr Zelensky.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
