OL,3,AEurope targeted by spiralling campaign
OL,4,Aof sabotage - and Russia is the chief
OL,5,Asuspect
OL,6,
OL,7,FAs summer temperatures in Europe
OL,8,Fsmashed records and many politicians
OL,9,Fshifted to holiday mode, Russia
OL,10,Fremained focused on its war.
OL,12,FNot only did its military attacks
OL,13,Facross Ukraine intensify last month,
OL,14,Fbecoming ever more deadly for
OL,15,Fcivilians, Russia also appears to have
OL,16,Fescalated its sabotage campaign across
OL,17,FEurope.
OL,19,FThis time, military and defence sector
OL,20,Fsites were the prime target.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
